#: 2557f45f4bbb4ea38ab12c82b83df253
msgid "Ascend 910B setup and validation"
msgstr "昇腾 910B 配置与验证"

#: 48370c6285904eb1ad6585b421c28442
msgid ""
"This guide configures a Jittor 2.0 source checkout for Ascend 910B-series"
" devices and verifies that an operation really executes through ACL. "
"Installing the Ascend driver, firmware, and CANN itself is outside "
"Jittor's scope; start from a host where the vendor runtime and compiler "
"are already installed."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍如何为昇腾 910B 系列设备配置 Jittor 2.0 源码检出，并验证算子"
"确实通过 ACL 执行。昇腾驱动、固件和 CANN 本身的安装不属于 Jittor 的范围；"
"请从已经安装厂商运行时和编译器的主机开始。"

#: d7fbb973d83e4a55a1f5c3986599be70
msgid "Validated baseline"
msgstr "已验证基线"

#: 1b3cbeaeb25e42e98b84235683ed5a9c
msgid "The maintained gate was validated on this combination:"
msgstr "维护中的门禁已在以下组合上完成验证："

#: c1df145541754a4fb719ef47d99fde34
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: 8205abd83b814708ac61ef50154d9d4d
msgid "Validated version"
msgstr "已验证版本"

#: 8d38ebd871324f6bb85ef352b7cec77b
msgid "Device"
msgstr "设备"

#: 87145834fed54bbaadfc9be19dae0d84
msgid "Ascend 910B3"
msgstr "昇腾 910B3"

#: 690b13cbd2dd4dce859a1b5bfcc4009e
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: 838f128563744bbc9acf18b5ad71ddb4
msgid "Linux aarch64"
msgstr "Linux aarch64"

#: fb11455ee4fb4e919c0011cb5eb35a34
msgid "Driver reported by `npu-smi`"
msgstr "`npu-smi` 报告的驱动版本"

#: f1626864821648b0a318b98c93e41c06
msgid "25.5.1"
msgstr "25.5.1"

#: b92ff674c13d4d20852145cc1f9ee4c0
msgid "CANN toolkit and `ccec`"
msgstr "CANN 工具包和 `ccec`"

#: ba5c4d9093a64264a878c7dcf49e030a
msgid "9.0.0"
msgstr "9.0.0"

#: eb6a29e807634a6aa97b4844029abc14
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: c8686debe9b345f29d55650aaa15c4d6
msgid "3.9.25"
msgstr "3.9.25"

#: 84f83242a8e149cd924cb4e6e83c28b4
msgid "NumPy"
msgstr "NumPy"

#: 07865db613e445e087c98d93ae9773c2
msgid "1.26.4"
msgstr "1.26.4"

#: af7778b00cc8436d9da64c0289bbc691
msgid "pytest / pytest-timeout"
msgstr "pytest / pytest-timeout"

#: 58d509e7e77d46069226faf9dc291d71
msgid "7.4.4 / 2.3.1"
msgstr "7.4.4 / 2.3.1"

#: 7a9996889b0842b3af81e2ad34eadde2
msgid ""
"These versions are a reproduced baseline, not a claim that every other "
"CANN release is incompatible. Jittor declares Python 3.7 through 3.13 "
"support; Python 3.9 through 3.11 is the practical range for an Ascend "
"environment whose vendor packages may have narrower Python constraints."
msgstr ""
"这些版本是一组可复现基线，并不表示其他 CANN 版本都不兼容。Jittor 声明支持 "
"Python 3.7 至 3.13；考虑到昇腾厂商包可能采用更窄的 Python 版本约束，"
"Python 3.9 至 3.11 是更实用的范围。"

#: a417a9218d32455a82074b619671ff7f
msgid "Check the device and toolkit"
msgstr "检查设备与工具包"

#: 1803adb4f78940f1be3dcc19b981cce2
msgid "Confirm that the driver sees a healthy device before importing Jittor:"
msgstr "导入 Jittor 前，确认驱动能够识别健康的设备："

#: 7d5fae0a62844f308cdcec4f8207fab6
msgid ""
"Find the CANN environment script and load it in the current shell. Keep "
"its location configurable instead of embedding a host-specific "
"installation path:"
msgstr ""
"找到 CANN 环境脚本并在当前 shell 中加载。应让脚本位置可配置，不要嵌入"
"特定主机的安装路径："

#: 978afbc6453346dc956a8a6ecf93fd1b
msgid ""
"`npu-smi info` must succeed in the same execution environment as Python. "
"In a container, pass the required Ascend devices and driver libraries "
"through using the vendor container runtime instructions."
msgstr ""
"`npu-smi info` 必须在与 Python 相同的执行环境中成功。在容器中，请按照"
"厂商容器运行时说明传入所需的昇腾设备和驱动库。"

#: a850bc6543b442988efda641d57c34b5
msgid "Install the source checkout"
msgstr "安装源码检出"

#: 7c7a84bb586b44d78ebd9fafc9929d4f
msgid ""
"Create a dedicated Python environment and install the checkout in "
"editable mode. The NPU validation gate also needs SciPy and the pinned "
"pytest tools:"
msgstr ""
"创建专用 Python 环境，并以可编辑模式安装当前检出。NPU 验证门禁还需要 "
"SciPy 和固定版本的 pytest 工具："

#: 9b4c38346f0c4bf6963ab8897ccd23f0
msgid ""
"Run from the repository root. For development without an editable "
"install, place the checkout's Python package first:"
msgstr ""
"请在仓库根目录运行。如果开发时不采用可编辑安装，请将当前检出的 Python 包"
"放在搜索路径首位："

#: 6938c3bb496e40a586ea0db96b8a7564
msgid "Isolate JIT state"
msgstr "隔离 JIT 状态"

#: 9fcad47795284bda8de11fc76ed3762d
msgid ""
"Jittor compiles its core and operators on first use. Put mutable state "
"outside the checkout and give every concurrent run a distinct "
"`JITTOR_HOME` or `cache_name`:"
msgstr ""
"Jittor 会在首次使用时编译核心和算子。请把可变状态放在源码检出之外，并为"
"每个并发任务分配不同的 `JITTOR_HOME` 或 `cache_name`："

#: baa73f9d132c43f7b3069250ddca43e8
msgid ""
"Run the first JIT or extension compile serially. Tests and benchmarks "
"must not share a compilation cache. After changing CANN, the driver, the "
"host compiler, or ACL source, use a new cache name; do not diagnose the "
"new stack with stale binaries."
msgstr ""
"首次 JIT 或扩展编译应串行运行。测试和基准不得共享编译缓存。更换 CANN、"
"驱动、主机编译器或 ACL 源码后，请使用新的缓存名称；不要用旧二进制诊断"
"新的软件栈。"

#: 52cb98d06d564e61972c2fef1d387152
msgid "Select a device"
msgstr "选择设备"

#: e52ef5fc3fdc473c9a3aa9296894ed54
msgid "Restrict the process to allocated devices before importing Jittor:"
msgstr "导入 Jittor 前，将进程限制到已分配的设备："

#: 7a6344a426ef46e2a9cfc4e47b23a31f
msgid ""
"The visible device is renumbered inside the process. Do not select a "
"device that is already occupied by another workload."
msgstr ""
"可见设备会在进程内重新编号。不要选择已经被其他工作负载占用的设备。"

#: f806550651e9499abdbc526b4206c53b
msgid "Run a real ACL probe"
msgstr "运行真实 ACL 探针"

#: 727ad64820b9430ab02d1f467c7271aa
msgid ""
"An import-only check cannot prove NPU support. The following probe "
"requires ACL, enables the accelerator flags, performs float32 matrix "
"multiplication, and checks both its independent result and the ACL "
"compilation log:"
msgstr ""
"仅检查导入成功不能证明 NPU 支持。下面的探针要求 ACL 可用，启用加速器标志，"
"执行 float32 矩阵乘法，并同时检查独立计算结果和 ACL 编译日志："

#: 1aafad5cade54f0d82ecb2202a22bd01
msgid ""
"Save the probe as `probe_acl.py` outside the checkout and run it only "
"after sourcing CANN:"
msgstr ""
"将探针保存为源码检出之外的 `probe_acl.py`，并只在加载 CANN 环境后运行："

#: 83eb4bac6674440181654bcb3feafbda
msgid ""
"Jittor uses `use_cuda` as the common accelerator execution flag even when"
" the selected backend is ACL. `has_acl` is therefore the required "
"discriminator between Ascend and CUDA."
msgstr ""
"即使选择的后端是 ACL，Jittor 也使用 `use_cuda` 作为通用加速器执行标志。"
"因此必须用 `has_acl` 区分昇腾与 CUDA。"

#: 3b20d89eb36c4cd6935cf3f2a354ca1e
msgid "Run the maintained NPU gate"
msgstr "运行维护中的 NPU 门禁"

#: 0751c94c0b244203993a7bbbe90dae9b
msgid ""
"The NPU nox session creates isolated state, checks `npu-smi`, runs a real"
" ACL matmul probe, and then executes the maintained backend and OpInfo "
"tests. Nox itself uses Python 3.11, while `JITTOR_CI_PYTHON` points to "
"the pre-provisioned Ascend Python environment:"
msgstr ""
"NPU nox 会话会创建隔离状态、检查 `npu-smi`、运行真实 ACL 矩阵乘法探针，"
"随后执行维护中的后端和 OpInfo 测试。Nox 本身使用 Python 3.11，而 "
"`JITTOR_CI_PYTHON` 指向预先配置好的昇腾 Python 环境："

#: bc93d6619a56402eb9b6adfac16a586a
msgid ""
"The session resolves `python_config_path` from `JITTOR_CI_PYTHON` rather "
"than from Nox's own interpreter. If a direct launch sets "
"`python_config_path`, it must point to the config helper for that same "
"Python version; a mismatched helper produces an extension suffix that the "
"hardware Python cannot import."
msgstr ""
"该会话会从 `JITTOR_CI_PYTHON` 而不是 Nox 自身的解释器解析 "
"`python_config_path`。如果直接启动时设置了 `python_config_path`，它必须指向"
"同一 Python 版本的配置辅助程序；不匹配的辅助程序会生成硬件 Python 无法导入的"
"扩展后缀。"

#: 8fb91b4654f6410787b2328bcb80a7f8
msgid "To run the same core tests directly:"
msgstr "如需直接运行同一组核心测试："

#: 09db9639bc2a4b4aa6976ba1d2c57a06
msgid ""
"Do not treat a passing CPU fallback as NPU coverage. For a new or "
"repaired operation, add a focused assertion that captures ACL execution "
"or otherwise proves the declared device performed the calculation."
msgstr ""
"不要把通过的 CPU fallback 当作 NPU 覆盖。对于新增或修复的算子，应添加"
"捕获 ACL 执行的定向断言，或用其他方式证明计算确实由所声明的设备完成。"

#: 6ae22936a9b14210820e33b33e96bcfd
msgid "Run Qwen3-8B with Transformers"
msgstr "使用 Transformers 运行 Qwen3-8B"

#: 5e0938aa0de6490abb0b3be2a43ec3a6
msgid ""
"The maintained manual probe runs a local Qwen3 checkpoint through the "
"Jittor Torch shim and Transformers 4.56.2. Install the optional model "
"dependencies and keep the checkpoint outside the source tree:"
msgstr ""
"维护中的手动探针通过 Jittor Torch shim 和 Transformers 4.56.2 运行本地 "
"Qwen3 检查点。请安装可选模型依赖，并将检查点保存在源码树之外："

#: 3ead312662594c47bc07b02b71815098
msgid ""
"Run this command only after the CANN, device-selection, and isolated-cache "
"setup above. The probe loads weights on CPU, explicitly migrates the model "
"to the visible NPU, prints `npu-smi` while the model is resident, performs "
"greedy eager attention generation with KV cache, and fails if generation "
"logs an ACL backend fallback or an unexpected CPU-compiled operation. CPU "
"checkpoint deserialization is expected and is not used as evidence for the "
"model forward."
msgstr ""
"仅在完成上述 CANN、设备选择和隔离缓存配置后运行此命令。探针在 CPU 加载"
"权重，再将模型显式迁移到可见 NPU；模型驻留期间会打印 `npu-smi`，随后使用 "
"KV cache 执行贪心 eager attention 生成。如果生成日志出现 ACL 后端 fallback "
"或非预期的 CPU 编译算子，探针会失败。CPU 检查点反序列化是预期行为，不作为"
"模型前向计算的验证证据。"

#: 7c392f76ed6547cc92d5577503e62546
msgid ""
"The validated Qwen3-8B checkpoint has 8,190,735,360 parameters. With "
"float32 weights on one 64 GB 910B3, the process used 32,376 MB of device "
"memory and generated token `4` for the probe prompt. The accepted result "
"reported `is_cuda=true`, `has_acl=use_acl=use_cuda=1`, and "
"`fallback_count=0`. The model forward used ACL, while the final greedy token "
"selection compiled one `arg_reduce` operation for CPU. This one-token "
"correctness probe is not a throughput benchmark."
msgstr ""
"已验证的 Qwen3-8B 检查点包含 8,190,735,360 个参数。在一张 64 GB 910B3 上"
"使用 float32 权重时，进程占用 32,376 MB 设备内存，并为探针提示词生成 token "
"`4`。通过的结果报告 `is_cuda=true`、`has_acl=use_acl=use_cuda=1` 和 "
"`fallback_count=0`。模型前向使用 ACL，而最后的贪心 token 选择有一个 "
"`arg_reduce` 算子在 CPU 编译。这个单 token 正确性探针不是吞吐量基准。"

#: 5afbbdbfdb7942ab82a6d9674525a5e2
msgid "Current limitations"
msgstr "当前限制"

#: 4e8ca41223a0495fb936777190498b92
msgid ""
"The maintained 910B gate deliberately skips these reproduced gaps instead"
" of allowing them to abort or stall the process:"
msgstr ""
"维护中的 910B 门禁会明确跳过以下已复现缺口，避免它们导致进程中止或停滞："

#: a2464eba7b79444390cc92469ff57f53
msgid ""
"sub-32-bit integer `sum`, `prod`, `max`, and `min`, plus boolean `all` "
"and `any`, lack a complete ACL reduction path; promote inputs to a "
"supported width when possible;"
msgstr ""
"低于 32 位的整数 `sum`、`prod`、`max` 和 `min`，以及布尔 `all` 和 "
"`any`，尚无完整 ACL 归约路径；条件允许时请将输入提升到受支持的位宽；"

#: cfd09dce6e7f4e318df6859dfd45302b
msgid "composed float32 `atan2` can raise a vector-core exception;"
msgstr "组合实现的 float32 `atan2` 可能触发 vector core 异常；"

#: 5b86b6a1e28f4c8ab310a43e99384e2b
msgid "complex `irfft` can stall;"
msgstr "复数 `irfft` 可能停滞；"

#: 91d952743b7c4cd087cd432fd231b658
msgid "float32 `prod` can abort in the ACL reduction path;"
msgstr "float32 `prod` 可能在 ACL 归约路径中中止进程；"

#: c5ff095ca0f748da91ac3ea49a6a78a8
msgid ""
"native FlashAttention tests require an optional `jt.nn.FlashAttention` "
"implementation and are skipped when it is absent;"
msgstr ""
"原生 FlashAttention 测试需要可选的 `jt.nn.FlashAttention` 实现；缺少该"
"实现时会跳过；"

#: 7c0d70c87b6f4633860a3ddd4de5de45
msgid ""
"the validated Transformers Qwen3-8B path uses float32; bfloat16 generation "
"currently reaches an unsupported ACL binary operation and is rejected "
"because it falls back to CPU;"
msgstr ""
"已验证的 Transformers Qwen3-8B 路径使用 float32；bfloat16 生成当前会进入"
"不受支持的 ACL 二元操作，并因回退到 CPU 而被拒绝；"

#: 9be147f0d21844019b005f7dc091ad89
msgid ""
"Qwen3 greedy token selection currently compiles the final `arg_reduce` on "
"CPU; the model forward remains on ACL, but fully device-resident generation "
"is not yet claimed;"
msgstr ""
"Qwen3 贪心 token 选择目前会在 CPU 编译最后的 `arg_reduce`；模型前向仍在 ACL "
"执行，但尚不宣称生成过程完全驻留在设备上；"

#: e4258c475ba343c2a67dd6950f0976f8
msgid ""
"ACL does not provide general float64 operator coverage, so float64 "
"fallback is not accepted as evidence for an NPU operation."
msgstr ""
"ACL 不提供通用的 float64 算子覆盖，因此不能把 float64 fallback 视为 NPU "
"算子的验证证据。"

#: 678bc6e660684656bcdbe3a15b510a23
msgid ""
"See the [active known-issues "
"ledger](https://github.com/Jittor/jittor/blob/master/agent/manuals/known-"
"issues.md) for executable evidence and exit conditions."
msgstr ""
"有关可执行证据和退出条件，请参阅[当前已知问题总账]"
"(https://github.com/Jittor/jittor/blob/master/agent/manuals/known-issues.md)。"

#: de8533f82b334a17bd36a539ac7d9ec6
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: 85d1c5a0a2fe4a76b38ff0be063e3924
msgid ""
"If ACL is not detected, verify `CANN_SET_ENV`, `ccec --version`, the "
"Python architecture, and the CANN library paths in the same shell. Do not"
" catch and ignore CANN registration or compilation errors; an incomplete "
"backend setup must fail visibly."
msgstr ""
"如果未检测到 ACL，请在同一个 shell 中检查 `CANN_SET_ENV`、"
"`ccec --version`、Python 架构和 CANN 库路径。不要捕获并忽略 CANN 注册或"
"编译错误；后端配置不完整时必须明确失败。"

#: 1047e43f1c52423e81fac91f2ad3ea94
msgid ""
"If an asynchronous device error is reported after the Python operation "
"that caused it, rerun only the smallest reproducer with:"
msgstr ""
"如果异步设备错误在引发问题的 Python 操作之后才被报告，请仅使用以下设置"
"重新运行最小复现："

#: 5fb9a698f8cb4b6f8cf716b4828465a3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"These flags are diagnostic and slow execution. Remove them after locating"
" the failing operation. For general JIT and memory diagnostics, see "
"{doc}`debugging`."
msgstr ""
"这些标志用于诊断，会降低执行速度。定位失败操作后应将其移除。通用 JIT 和"
"内存诊断请参阅 {doc}`debugging`。"
